---
Enforce minimum window size to prevent layout breakage.

Set SDL minimum window size so the GUI doesn't break when resized
too small.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Minimum window size set (e.g. 800x600)
- [ ] SDL_SetWindowMinimumSize called at window creation
- [ ] Window cannot be resized below minimum
- [ ] Layout remains functional at minimum size

## Test Plan
- [ ] Try to resize window below minimum, verify it stops
- [ ] Verify layout at minimum size is usable
